    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d444">

                <pb facs="0912" n="878" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v15p1/pg878"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/4–653: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Embassy in Korea</hi><anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d444-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1953-04-06T18:03:00-05:00">April 6, 1953—6:03
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>624. Department distribution only. CINCFE in C
                    61736 April 4<anchor n="2" xml:id="d444-f2"/> has informed Department Army (1)
                    serious consequences US and UN could result from active opposition ROK Government to further armistice negotiations or
                    agreements (2) possible course action their part could include (a) withdrawal
                        ROK representatives UNC armistice delegation or (b) at worst attempt withdraw elements
                        ROK Army from UN control and remove ROK Government officials from UN influence (3)
                    plans at hand to meet emergency arising from latter contingency and all probable
                    contingencies are under continuing study. CINCUNC recommends <pb facs="0913" n="879" xml:id="pg879"/> State
                    take appropriate action influence ROK Government
                    conform UN actions.</p>
                <p>Department considering joint State–Defense telegram CINCUNC requesting close Embassy-CINCUNC coordination political and military implications ROK resistance armistice negotiations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Dulles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
